WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:18.640
We're the Kennedy Family, we've been in New
Zealand nearly 12 years this year.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:23.590
We first moved to the North Island in Taranaki
and have worked our way steadily down the

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:28.860
country until we now live in Rangiora in Waimakariri.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.340
We've met some great people and it's a great
place to live.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:37.020
We really feel like we've made the right decision
in where we live at the moment, it's fantastic.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.000
We took it very seriously, making the decision.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.360
One, that it was right for us and we like
the country,

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.620
we've been made to feel really welcome.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:59.059
It is now our home and the fact that we've
set it as our home, we thought that we'd take

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.960
the next step and become citizens.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.740
We've been very lucky today, to have this
land on Waitangi Day and at the marae

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:08.640
has been really good.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.800
We feel really privileged actually.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:19.080
Saying the words, receiving the certificate,
it's quite special.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:22.690
It's something we'll never forget.

